    <li><strong>Point-in-time snapshots</strong> — rankings change monthly and past performance does not predict future results.</li>
    <li><strong>Algorithm-driven</strong> — based on a defined scoring system with both objective (review data) and subjective (editorial assessment) components.</li>
    <li><strong>Inherently limited</strong> — they cannot capture every aspect of business quality, customer experience, or individual suitability.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>BBI makes no representation that our rankings are exhaustive or that they include every business in a given category or city. Absence from our rankings does not imply anything negative about a business.</p>

